    GC_Briefing "{6906E78AA24EF1FB}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Move up, sweep the forests and secure the 3x Critical Buildings within Kamoryn Military Base."\
     ""\
     "Utilize AT mines with TSh 400g Esplosives to blow up the walls surrounding the compound (1x AT Mine + 1x TSh 400g, Connect to KPM 3U1 and detonate)"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_NVA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B6C09222F9BD4C75}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Defend the Kamoryn Military Base BY NOT losing 3x of the critical buildings (Marked)"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{11C354FFA3115EFE}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Push forward and secure the Military Base."\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is adviced to push the Company together as a solid unit,, while also utilize the BRDMs to push any forces away from the treeline or locating the enemy."\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is adviced to not spread the Platoons far from eachother so they can mutually support one another."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_NVA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{F3D42D00ECB5F635}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Defend the Military Base at all costs."\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is adviced to the Platoon to setup killzones on likely attack routes, find and destroy the enemy BRDMs and prepare fallback positions."\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is adviced to NOT split up the sections too far so they can mutually support one another or be able to quickly support as needed."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{59381466EF5238E4}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Soviet Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Soviet Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     ""\
     "Each BRDM contains:"\
     "- 4x Bandages"\
     "- 4x Tourniquets"\
     "- 4x Morphines"\
     "- 100x NVA AK Mags"\
     "- 50x NVA RPK Mags"\
     "- 4x Grenades"\
     "- 4x Smoke Grenades"\
     "- 50x Handheld White Flares"\
     "- 50x Handheld Orange Flares"\
     "- 50x Handheld Green Flares"\
     "- 10x AT Mines"\
     "- 50x TSh 400g Explosives"\
     "- 10x Blasting Machine KPM 3U1"\
     "- 10x Backpacks"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Platoon Aid Post is to be setup by Platoon medics."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot or with company asset like the BTRs if there are any."\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Platoon medpack carried by Platoon medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "2x BRDMs"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_NVA"
     }
    }
